ockman 夺权挂帅","originalTitle":"","summary":"OpenAI宣布进行史上最大规模重组，将ChatGPT、Codex和API三大核心产品线合并为统一组织。联合创始人兼总裁Greg Brockman正式全面接管产品战略，成为实际掌权者，而ChatGPT原负责人Nick Turley被调离核心岗位。此次重组旨在整合资源，聚焦“智能体时代”，并秘密开发集成多项功能的“超级应用”桌面端产品。与此同时，竞争对手Anthropic估值飙升至9000亿美元，使OpenAI面临严峻挑战。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp81gwxx0ezsslnze6fa6wif","originalUrl":"https://www.ithome.com/0/951/258.htm","publishedAt":"2026-05-17T00:00:00.333Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-23t2ho","originalSourceName":"IT之家·人工智能","family":"outlet-115kagi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp81gwxx0ezsslnze6fa6wif","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-09T22:41:36.113Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-23t2ho","name":"IT之家·人工智能","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-09T22:41:36.113Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"OpenAI宣布进行史上最大规模重组，将ChatGPT、Codex和API三大核心产品线合并为统一组织。联合创始人兼总裁Greg Brockman正式全面接管产品战略，成为实际掌权者，而ChatGPT原负责人Nick Turley被调离核心岗位。此次重组旨在整合资源，聚焦“智能体时代”，并秘密开发集成多项功能的“超级应用”桌面端产品。与此同时，竞争对手Anthropic估值飙升至9000亿美元，使OpenAI面临严峻挑战。","reportEdition":"2026-05-17","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp8ghucy0iflslnzvk74bcu0","title":"杭州基地启用，机器人有了国家级职业技能训练场","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-05-17T00:00:00.333Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp8ghucy0iflslnzvk74bcu0","https://www.ithome.com/0/951/390.htm"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp8ghucy0iflslnzvk74bcu0","title":"杭州基地启用，机器人有了国家级职业技能训练场","originalTitle":"","summary":"国家人工智能应用中试基地（具身智能）5月16日在浙江杭州挂牌启用，为机器人提供国家级职业技能训练场。该基地是集场景体验、技术展示、研发合作、产业赋能于一体的综合性平台，旨在推动具身智能技术从实验室迈向现实应用。杭州市于5月1日施行首部具身智能机器人地方性法规，支持核心研发、平台建设和场景开放。目前杭州已集聚机器人产业相关企业700余家，2025年具身智能产业集群产值达1068亿元。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp8ghucy0iflslnzvk74bcu0","originalUrl":"https://www.ithome.com/0/951/390.htm","publishedAt":"2026-05-17T00:00:00.333Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-23t2ho","originalSourceName":"IT之家·人工智能","family":"outlet-115kagi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp8ghucy0iflslnzvk74bcu0","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-09T22:41:36.113Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-23t2ho","name":"IT之家·人工智能","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-09T22:41:36.113Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"国家人工智能应用中试基地（具身智能）5月16日在浙江杭州挂牌启用，为机器人提供国家级职业技能训练场。该基地是集场景体验、技术展示、研发合作、产业赋能于一体的综合性平台，旨在推动具身智能技术从实验室迈向现实应用。杭州市于5月1日施行首部具身智能机器人地方性法规，支持核心研发、平台建设和场景开放。目前杭州已集聚机器人产业相关企业700余家，2025年具身智能产业集群产值达1068亿元。","reportEdition":"2026-05-17","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp87jb0m0gdwslnz8kprg5f6","title":"OpenAI 与马耳他合作，向所有公民提供 ChatGPT Plus","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-05-17T00:00:00.333Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp87jb0m0gdwslnz8kprg5f6","https://openai.com/index/malta-chatgpt-plus-partnership"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp87jb0m0gdwslnz8kprg5f6","title":"OpenAI 与马耳他合作，向所有公民提供 ChatGPT Plus","originalTitle":"","summary":"OpenAI 与马耳他政府达成合作，将向该国所有公民免费提供 ChatGPT Plus 