的实现成本下降迅速；在2026年，训练强大围棋AI仅需几千美元租赁算力，无需DeepMind级别的资源。他荣幸受邀在播客中分享这一过程，并提供了详细教程和代码，同时谦虚自称围棋与AlphaGo学徒，对任何事实错误负责。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp8rm09c0kyaslnz4buzad07","originalUrl":"https://x.com/pmarca/status/2055723987850690927","publishedAt":"2026-05-17T00:00:00.333Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-ew8szu","originalSourceName":"X：Marc Andreessen (@pmarca, a16z)","family":"outlet-1stp5td","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp8rm09c0kyaslnz4buzad07","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-09T22:41:36.113Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-ew8szu","name":"X：Marc Andreessen (@pmarca, a16z)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-09T22:41:36.113Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"Eric Jang在过去几个月从零开始实现AlphaGo，这是2016年激发他进入深度学习的AI突破。他最初理解AlphaGo为“通过自我对弈训练的搜索增强深度神经网络”，但通过亲手构建获得了更深层次的理解。他指出，前沿深度学习研究虽昂贵，但特定能力的实现成本下降迅速；在2026年，训练强大围棋AI仅需几千美元租赁算力，无需DeepMind级别的资源。他荣幸受邀在播客中分享这一过程，并提供了详细教程和代码，同时谦虚自称围棋与AlphaGo学徒，对任何事实错误负责。","reportEdition":"2026-05-17","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp8miqno0jrsslnzj4y4ud9v","title":"最新开源成果（#21）：开源模型盛宴！Gemma 4、DeepSeek V4、Kimi K2.6、MiMo 2.5、GLM-5.1 等。基于CAISI的V4评估。","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-05-17T00:00:00.333Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmp8miqno0jrsslnzj4y4ud9v","https://www.interconnects.ai/p/latest-open-artifacts-21-open-model"],"articles":[{"id":"cmp8miqno0jrsslnzj4y4ud9v","title":"最新开源成果（#21）：开源模型盛宴！Gemma 4、DeepSeek V4、Kimi K2.6、MiMo 2.5、GLM-5.1 等。基于CAISI的V4评估。","originalTitle":"","summary":"本月开源AI模型领域迎来密集发布，包括Gemma 4、DeepSeek V4、Kimi K2.6、MiMo 2.5和GLM-5.1等一系列重要新版本。这些模型均在CAISI的V4评估框架下进行了性能评测。多个团队几乎同期推出旗舰级更新，反映出开源社区当前高速迭代的竞争态势。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp8miqno0jrsslnzj4y4ud9v","originalUrl":"https://www.interconnects.ai/p/latest-open-artifacts-21-open-model","publishedAt":"2026-05-17T00:00:00.333Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-gw7nds","originalSourceName":"Nathan Lambert：Interconnects（RSS）","family":"outlet-1h63bhw","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmp8miqno0jrsslnzj4y4ud9v","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-09T22:41:36.113Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-gw7nds","name":"Nathan Lambert：Interconnects（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-09T22:41:36.113Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"本月开源AI模型领域迎来密集发布，包括Gemma 4、DeepSeek V4、Kimi K2.6、MiMo 2.5和GLM-5.1等一系列重要新版本。这些模型均在CAISI的V4评估框架下进行了性能评测。多个团队几乎同期推出旗舰级更新，反映出开源社区当前高速迭代的竞争态势。","reportEdition":"2026-05-17","reportKind":"daily"}],"total":9,"partial":false,"itemSourceCount":7,"topics":[{"topic":"模型","count":2},{"topic":"应用","count":2},{"topic":"行业","count":3},{"topic":"开发","count":2}],"method":"AIHOT 提供选题、摘要与编排；模境保留来源与报告窗口，关联模型数据。原报道与模型评测分别核对，不将资讯排名当作能力评分。"}}
